url: "https://skandotai.github.io/agentic-ontology-of-work/"
abstract: >
  A platform-agnostic semantic model for intelligent, autonomous, and
  governed enterprise work: 25 classes and 33 relationships across four
  layers (Perception, Cognition, Execution, Assurance), including a
  five-level Assurance Level scale for governed autonomy. Published as a
  whitepaper and as an OWL ontology with a JSON-LD context, SHACL shapes,
  JSON Schemas, SPARQL queries, and validated examples.
